softridge 0.2.0

- Implements the numerical core in RcppArmadillo: thin SVD, ridge paths,
  thresholding, coefficient arrays, exact Gaussian risk, SURE, and CV/refit scores.
- Preserves R interfaces, fold-local preprocessing, singular-value cutoff,
  candidate grids, and column-order tie handling.
- Native kernels do not consume RNG draws and do not use OpenMP.
- The surrounding research workflow separately records the predeclared
  HR-SURE undefined-variance event; this is not a new variance estimator.
